{"author":{"id":"89da5fec8eff6d69dbcdd68f81be7e9163b16f34b17e978ecf3554487379f453"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1774053197,"nonce":"APuz9eHVqlHq4FFAACxgq1cOTc0=","title":"Partition B: Presets Tab UI — tree editor, library view, diff view, insert modal","message":"All Presets tab UI work:\n\n**API client** (modify ui/src/api.ts):\n- All preset CRUD functions, node operations, session-preset associations\n- Library query, export/import, union computation\n- Preset diff operations\n\n**Tab registration** (modify ui/src/app.tsx):\n- Add \"presets\" to Route tab union type and parseHashRoute\n- Add tab to overflow navigation group (with icon)\n- Add keyboard shortcut\n- Conditional rendering for presets view\n\n**State management** (modify ui/src/state.ts):\n- Add PresetsState to AppState: selectedPresetId, presets[], nodes[], libraryMode, editingNodeId\n- Add preset actions to AppAction union\n- Reducer cases for preset CRUD, node CRUD, library toggle\n- SSE event handlers: preset:created, preset:updated, preset:deleted, preset:diff:created\n\n**Presets tab view** (new ui/src/views/presets.tsx):\n- Two-pane layout: sidebar (useSidebarResize) + main content\n- Sidebar: \"Convention Library\" entry at top (distinct icon), then preset list with token badges (~2.1K)\n- Main area: tree editor (when preset selected) or library view (when library selected)\n- \"Start Chat\" button in header area\n- Mobile: below 700px, sidebar takes full width with back-navigation\n\n**Tree editor component** (new ui/src/components/presets/PresetTree.tsx + PresetNode.tsx):\n- Recursive PresetNode rendering\n- View mode: title as \u003ch2\u003e/\u003ch3\u003e/etc, body rendered via marked + sanitizeInlineHtml (same pipeline as issues.tsx)\n- Edit mode: inline title input (same font/size, no layout jump) + monospace body textarea\n- Save on blur/Ctrl+Enter, cancel on Escape\n- No visible borders by default — hierarchy via left-padding (16px per level)\n- On hover: thin left border (2px solid rgba(77,163,255,0.3)), subtle background (rgba(255,255,255,0.02))\n- Actions on hover: drag handle (6-dot grip) left of heading, \"...\" menu right (Edit, Add child, Split into children, Move up/down, Delete, Copy)\n- Copy: plain text clipboard (leaf: own content, group: concatenated subtree)\n- \"Split into children\" dropdown action: parses headings in body, creates child nodes (only on leaves, grayed out otherwise)\n- Undo/redo: command pattern (MoveNode, DeleteNode, EditContent, AddNode), each stores inverse, stack cap ~50, Cmd+Z/Cmd+Shift+Z scoped to editor\n- Keyboard nav: Arrow Up/Down between siblings, Right to expand/enter children, Left to collapse/go to parent, Enter to edit, Escape to stop editing, Tab between interactive elements within node\n- Alt+Up/Down: reorder siblings, Alt+Left: outdent, Alt+Right: indent\n- ARIA: role=\"tree\", role=\"treeitem\", aria-expanded, aria-level, aria-posinset, aria-setsize\n- Focus management: after add → focus new node, after delete → focus nearest sibling/parent\n\n**Drag-and-drop** (install @atlaskit/pragmatic-drag-and-drop + hitbox):\n- draggable() + dropTargetForElements() on each tree node\n- closestEdge from hitbox: top edge = reorder above, bottom edge = reorder below, center = nest as child\n- Drop indicators: horizontal line at edges, highlighted background for nesting\n- Keyboard alternative: Alt+Arrow keys (above)\n\n**Preset diff view** (new ui/src/components/presets/PresetDiffView.tsx):\n- Side-by-side or unified diff between two presets or two versions\n- Node-level add/modify/delete color coding (green/yellow/red)\n- Reuse marked + sanitizeInlineHtml for rendering\n\n**Convention Library view** (new ui/src/components/presets/ConventionLibrary.tsx):\n- Flat, filterable, scrollable list of leaf conventions\n- Search bar (debounced full-text filter)\n- Each card: title, truncated body (~80 chars), source preset name(s), dedup indicator\n- Click to expand: full body rendered as Markdown\n- \"Add to Preset\" button on hover per card\n- Empty state guidance\n\n**Insert-from-Library modal** (new ui/src/components/presets/InsertFromLibraryModal.tsx):\n- Command palette style (like VS Code): search input at top, scrollable filtered results\n- Ctrl+I keyboard shortcut (or \"+\" button in tree editor toolbar)\n- Each result: title, source preset, body preview\n- Click/Enter → copy convention as new child of selected node (or root)\n- Modal closes, new node highlighted briefly\n\n**Promotion dialog** (new ui/src/components/presets/RoutingDialog.tsx):\n- Shows proposed preset diff (rendered as Markdown diff)\n- 3 buttons: \"This chat only\", \"Save to [preset]\" (dropdown of session presets, pre-selected by routing algorithm), \"Save to [base preset]\"\n- For global CLAUDE.md preset: different flow → \"File git-bug issue proposing change\"\n- Agent reasoning displayed (confidence, reason)\n\n**CSS** (modify ui/src/style.css):\n- All preset node styles (hover effects, edit mode, actions)\n- Tree indentation, drag indicators\n- Library card styles, modal styles\n- Use existing CSS variables: --bg-primary, --bg-secondary, --bg-card, --text-primary, --text-muted, --accent-yellow, --accent-green\n\nBug: 877ab44","files":null}]}